### Get documents
GET {{baseApiPath}}/households/103/documents
Content-Type: application/json

### Upload document
# Place a local PDF named household-documents-fixture.pdf next to this file before running this request.
POST {{baseApiPath}}/households/101/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="documentType"

PROOF_OF_INCOME
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="proof.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./household-documents-fixture.pdf
--WebAppBoundary--

### Import a document from the scanner folder
POST {{baseApiPath}}/households/101/documents/from-scanner-file
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fileName": "scan1.pdf",
  "documentType": "OTHER"
}

### Download document
GET {{baseApiPath}}/households/101/documents/1

### Delete document
DELETE {{baseApiPath}}/households/101/documents/1

### Get scanner folder files
GET {{baseApiPath}}/document-scanner-files
Content-Type: application/json
